+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch document and returns a new JSON
+document. Object members set to `null` are removed, object members are merged recursively, and all
+other patch values replace the target. Neither input is mutated.
